          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 381.84,
          "end": 384.573,
          "en": "and then output the text of that question here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 386.31,
          "end": 389.91,
          "en": "With that if we save that, you see we're getting that list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 389.91,
          "end": 392.79,
          "en": "of questions on this screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 392.79,
          "end": 395.61,
          "en": "and we also see which answers were picked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 395.61,
          "end": 396.813,
          "en": "for every question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 397.8,
          "end": 399.72,
          "en": "Now it is of course possible",
          "zh": ""
